#: contents/ui/KdeConnectPanel.qml:1050
msgid "1. Install the KDE Connect app from the App Store.\n"
msgstr "1. Installieren Sie die App KDE Connect aus dem App Store.\n"

#: contents/ui/KdeConnectPanel.qml:1051
msgid "1. Install the KDE Connect app from the Play Store or F-Droid.\n"
